},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-29T11:38:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #9 from intuvance/chore/esm-framework-shell-and-ui-alignment\n\n(chore) esm framework shell and UI alignment\n\n1. Upgrade the app shell and framework to major version 8.x to ensure compatibility with federated OpenMRS ESM apps loaded via the import map.\n\n- Update @openmrs/esm-app-shell to ^8\n- Update @openmrs/esm-framework to ^8\n- Update react-i18next to ^16 to satisfy peer dependency requirements\n- Remove version mismatches causing Module Federation warnings for remote apps\n\n2. ReactWordcloud was re-rendering on every parent update, causing a blinking effect when typing or updating state. \n\n- Wrapped the ReactWordcloud component in useMemo to ensure it mounts only once.\n- Kept transitionDuration at 0 to fully disable animations.\n\n3. Moved the close button in the LLM Tools popup a few pixels up to prevent it from overlapping the container below. Updated CSS in llmtools-popup.styles.scss:\n\n- Set `.farRight` to `position: absolute` with `top` and `right` offsets to properly position the close button.\n\nThis pr addresses repeated warnings and Single-SPA lifecycle errors related to unsatisfied shared singleton versions, without changing app logic, ensures the word map stays stable while toggling the diagram or typing in related inputs and improves the visual layout and prevents display issues.","tree":{"sha":"93ec1ce2ff58cb3f15e5d878931a435f08cfeca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuvance/esm-expertsystem/git/trees/93ec1ce2ff58cb3f15e5d878931a435f08cfeca2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuvance/esm-expertsystem/git/commits/2f1de8e832b8f105a210ccfa6c790e0f28059f06","verification":{"payload":"tree 93ec1ce2ff58cb3f15e5d878931a435f08cfeca2\nparent 46372875a64f50a8367dcb34947aaec0bbf8f686\nparent 4da460deeaf38e3bc13717979b181c4b03c2b2ea\nauthor Christopher Miiro <christopher.miiro@gmail.com> 1767008327 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1767008327 +0300\n\nMerge pull request #9 from intuvance/chore/esm-framework-shell-and-ui-alignment\n\n(chore) esm framework shell and UI alignment\n\n1. Upgrade the app shell and framework to major version 8.x to ensure compatibility with federated OpenMRS ESM apps loaded via the import map.\n\n- Update @openmrs/esm-app-shell to ^8\n- Update @openmrs/esm-framework to ^8\n- Update react-i18next to ^16 to satisfy peer dependency requirements\n- Remove version mismatches causing Module Federation warnings for remote apps\n\n2. ReactWordcloud was re-rendering on every parent update, causing a blinking effect when typing or updating state. \n\n- Wrapped the ReactWordcloud component in useMemo to ensure it mounts only once.\n- Kept transitionDuration at 0 to fully disable animations.\n\n3. Moved the close button in the LLM Tools popup a few pixels up to prevent it from overlapping the container below. Updated CSS in llmtools-popup.styles.scss:\n\n- Set `.farRight` to `position: absolute` with `top` and `right` offsets to properly position the close button.\n\nThis pr addresses repeated warnings and Single-SPA lifecycle errors related to unsatisfied shared singleton versions, without changing app logic, ensures the word map stays stable while toggling the diagram or typing in related inputs and improves the visual layout and prevents display issues.\n\n\n\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpUmhHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7mMQACRY4QTfrw2fgBnmxRg2INjQ\nupNs2hJ8CVCGAOCgK+3ousDMndgmTiqiISXgrusCw7F9YYJVhkhU0TF4iH+EXuht\nZCKhN4oAS+/v6xllHfKVQ0a+UFw730/6iIJ9kvOyxbb6p7Y/6wS7Lcl5kGr90AYu\nz+hKAgYuO5/D30l9qGq3KL58MTtfup2DHI9qjsQnyudcRNKU0GHboEK3Dl6RxcjN\nN7L9/1uq1gTQJEdcKqEUHJs9M57bJ+LjwMij8gNyg5rGz/8Q5fZniBKKmWel9Nls\n61znMW4zzEUffsyujtI2y4AC2AaghnleIxjSWpn7IeYkx5nL9wCQpSJpJ5dsVeVv\n87bPRX2eM9RzbvbdWN1XX5+xC5wipBTnDqMYuW7rVqbt7CW/Fpa+kjZpNwIC/c55\n0sIC2dw57P1fiW1wE9JCgBJm7+ElaBTpGD4Im6ePD4tz4TBVYA8ynuaGLL4n