0bbf8f686/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-29T08:59:23Z","email":"christopher.miiro@gmail.com","name":"Christopher Miiro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-29T08:59:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #8 from intuvance/llmtools-feature-flags\n\n(feat)llmtools:Add config-based feature flag to enable or disable A.I  features UI. \n\nIntroduced a configuration-driven feature flag for the LLM Tools UI.\n\n- Adds `llmtools.enabled` to the app config schema with a default of `true`\n- Gates rendering of the LLM Tools entry point based on resolved OpenMRS config\n- Replaces ad-hoc environment/localStorage checks with a first-class config flag\n- Enables administrators to toggle LLM Tools without redeploying the frontend\n\nThis aligns llmtools with standard OpenMRS ESM feature-flagging practices and\nimproves deploy-time and runtime flexibility.","tree":{"sha":"9d753d8b9377437f04c557bb04fad209a81574aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuvance/esm-expertsystem/git/trees/9d753d8b9377437f04c557bb04fad209a81574aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuvance/esm-expertsystem/git/commits/46372875a64f50a8367dcb34947aaec0bbf8f686","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d753d8b9377437f04c557bb04fad209a81574aa\nparent fdee81330ddfdf4bb8cf08151486b3fb9ed82717\nparent 339a336967a4d81fa9cfae7fa66b7f18fd6fa554\nauthor Christopher Miiro <christopher.miiro@gmail.com> 1766998763 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1766998763 +0300\n\nMerge pull request #8 from intuvance/llmtools-feature-flags\n\n(feat)llmtools:Add config-based feature flag to enable or disable A.I  features UI. \n\nIntroduced a configuration-driven feature flag for the LLM Tools UI.\n\n- Adds `llmtools.enabled` to the app config schema with a default of `true`\n- Gates rendering of the LLM Tools entry point based on resolved OpenMRS config\n- Replaces ad-hoc environment/localStorage checks with a first-class config flag\n- Enables administra