ls:add config-based feature flag for LLM tools\n\nIntroduce a config-driven feature flag for the LLM Tools ESM app.\n\n- Add and export configSchema to define llmTools.enabled flag\n- Gate rendering of the LLM tools UI behind config instead of spaEnv/localStorage\n- Align app lifecycle with OpenMRS ESM v7 conventions using getAsyncLifecycle\n- Enable feature toggling via spa-assemble-config and Implementer Tools\n\nThis ensures the app renders correctly in RefApp and production environments while remaining disabled by default unless explicitly enabled.","tree":{"sha":"5041d10c8143ce5eadbf78d91259aa3f7d6a5b1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuvance/esm-expertsystem/git/trees/5041d10c8143ce5eadbf78d91259aa3f7d6a5b1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuvance/esm-expertsystem/git/commits/fdee81330ddfdf4bb8cf08151486b3fb9ed82717","verification":{"payload":"tree 5041d10c8143ce5eadbf78d91259aa3f7d6a5b1e\nparent 6fead8598c18c6f9cf8d69f1d91b848bd5cb5253\nparent a35dfd3a2fc25c79cae40858fac82fee6726ec0c\nauthor Christopher Miiro <christopher.miiro@gmail.com> 1766933708 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1766933708 +0300\n\nMerge pull request #7 from intuvance/llmtools-feature-flags\n\n(feat)llmtools:add config-based feature flag for LLM tools\n\nIntroduce a config-driven feature flag for the LLM Tools ESM app.\n\n- Add and export configSchema to define llmTools.enabled flag\n- Gate rendering of the LLM tools UI behind config instead of spaEnv/localStorage\n- Align app lifecycle with OpenMRS ESM v7 conventions using getAsyncLifecycle\n- Enable feature toggling via spa-assemble-config and Implementer Tools\n\nThis ensures the app renders correctly in RefApp and production environments while remaining disabled by default unless explicitly enabled.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpUUTMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2BsQAIovDf1y1RydKk9A7rCY5ARW\nREqtlzdZ5vrSNpPE30Wj4JxzU0VT4BFdGOHnS7hVcxj0fCo49PWzmpeL9SPLNlrA\n2f5OfAyhBFLkDeq