s redistribuidos)\n- Patrón: bajo → pico 20-30mm → descenso\n\nRisk: Bajo - solo datos de visualización\nRollback: git checkout HEAD~1 -- mock-data.js","tree":{"sha":"66e91047e036515848c84743f6cd0e406edd9db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/trees/66e91047e036515848c84743f6cd0e406edd9db0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/commits/f46c9fa2ba9ec6a07227a82712463f4438a4dd62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/f46c9fa2ba9ec6a07227a82712463f4438a4dd62","node_id":"C_kwDOPkJHP9oAKGY0NmM5ZmEyYmE5ZWM2YTA3MjI3YTgyNzEyNDYzZjQ0MzhhNGRkNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384","sha":"6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384"}],"sha":"f46c9fa2ba9ec6a07227a82712463f4438a4dd62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/f46c9fa2ba9ec6a07227a82712463f4438a4dd62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-09T15:31:04Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-09T15:31:04Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"message":"task: WU-XXX - Invertir patrones de frecuencia en histogramas\n\nInvierte los valores de frecuencia en todos los períodos de histograma\npara crear un patrón ascendente con valores más altos al final.\n\nWHAT: Modificación de datos mock en histogramFreq_30d, _10m, _6h, _24h\nWHY: Mejorar visibilidad de valores pequeños en gráfico de histograma\n\nDiffstat:\n- 4 arrays modificados (120 valores invertidos)\n- Patrón cambiado de descendente a ascendente\n- Valores finales ahora visibles (0.9-1.2 vs 0.0-0.1)\n\nRisk: Bajo - solo datos de visualización\nRollback: git checkout HEAD~1 -- mock-data.js","tree":{"sha":"12aabddaf701bc78e2617b07fba1cfdb2a6870ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/trees/12aabddaf701bc78e2617b07fba1cfdb2a6870ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/commits/6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384","node_id":"C_kwDOPkJHP9oAKDZiMmFlZGU1ZmQyOWUyMDI0MThlNzczMGU3NGM5OTNlZTA2ZWUzODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6","sha":"3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6"}],"sha":"6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/6b2aede5fd29e202418e7730e74c993ee06ee384"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-09T15:25:41Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-09T15:25:41Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"message":"task: WU-XXX - Suavizar curvas granulométricas eliminando saltos bruscos\n\nRefactorizar curvas acumulativas para seguir progresiones logarítmicas naturales.\nEliminar valores P50/P80 forzados que causaban discontinuidades.\nDiferenciar curvas por período temporal con variaciones realistas.\n\nCambios:\n- curvaGran_10m: Progresión más empinada para períodos cortos\n- curvaGran_6h: Suavizada con transiciones graduales\n- curvaGran_24h: Curva intermedia balanceada\n- curvaGran_30d: La más gradual para períodos largos\n\nRiesgo: Bajo. Solo datos mock sin impacto en lógica de negocio.\nRollback: Restaurar valores originales de pct en constantes curvaGran_*.","tree":{"sha":"f38d422fe5bc65bd325147c62b40008f389c579c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/trees/f38d422fe5bc65bd325147c62b40008f389c579c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/commits/3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6","node_id":"C_kwDOPkJHP9oAKDNjNzhhYzZlZTFlNTY0MzA4YzZjNWZmNmNlNjFmZWU0MzA2NWRiYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/2013968775693810891abb584aa73aa186b46ca5","sha":"2013968775693810891abb584aa73aa186b46ca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/2013968775693810891abb584aa73aa186b46ca5"}],"sha":"3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/3c78ac6ee1e564308c6c5ff6ce61fee43065dbb6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/2013968775693810891abb584aa73aa186b46ca5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-09T15:19:10Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-09T15:19:10Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"message":"task: WU-002 - Eliminar lógica de 7 días no utilizada\n\nRemueve datos y referencias de 7 días de curvaGranByPeriod y histogramFreqByPeriod:\n- El