ulometry-front/commits/945ed253b68f3b95165dd4005299d16fbbb2d500/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-09T00:57:11Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-09T00:57:11Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"message":"task: WU-029 - Migrate to official Tailwind tokens for card selection styles\n\nReplace HSL arbitrary values with blue-50/blue-300 tokens in CustomDateCard and TimeCard components for better stability and consistency with Tailwind v4.\n\nFiles changed:\n- components/CustomDateCard.jsx: Updated selection styles\n- components/TimeCard.jsx: Updated selection styles\n\nRisk: Low - visual styling change only\nRollback: Revert to HSL arbitrary values if needed","tree":{"sha":"39b28fe7eabe31eaedc15e0637e707bf920b4873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/trees/39b28fe7eabe31eaedc15e0637e707bf920b4873"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/commits/945ed253b68f3b95165dd4005299d16fbbb2d500","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/945ed253b68f3b95165dd4005299d16fbbb2d500","node_id":"C_kwDOPkJHP9oAKDk0NWVkMjUzYjY4ZjNiOTUxNjVkZDQwMDUyOTlkMTZmYmJiMmQ1MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e","sha":"f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e"}],"sha":"945ed253b68f3b95165dd4005299d16fbbb2d500","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/945ed253b68f3b95165dd4005299d16fbbb2d500"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-09T00:48:35Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-09T00:48:35Z","email":"cgonzalez@robotia.cl","name":"Camilo González"},"message":"task: WU-028 - Anclar etiquetas temporales del gráfico a Date.now()\n\nReemplaza etiquetas secuenciales (Min 1, Min 2, etc.) por timestamps reales:\n- 10 min: HH:mm cada 1 minuto desde now hacia atrás\n- 6 horas: HH:mm cada 30 minutos desde now hacia atrás\n- 24h/7d: DD MMM cada 1 día desde now hacia atrás\n- 30d: DD MMM cada 2 días desde now hacia atrás\n\nResuelve problema donde eje X mostraba etiquetas partiendo desde cero\nen lugar de usar timestamps anclados al momento actual.\n\nArchivos modificados:\n- index.jsx: Nueva función generateTimeLabels() y actualización de asExecTimeline()\n\nRiesgo: Bajo - Solo modifica lógica de etiquetas sin afectar estructura de datos\nRollback: Revertir función asExecTimeline a implementación con labelGenerator original","tree":{"sha":"1a0c3f65474ceb8b3109e3aed60c1ce3b6ac6ca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/trees/1a0c3f65474ceb8b3109e3aed60c1ce3b6ac6ca8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/git/commits/f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e","node_id":"C_kwDOPkJHP9oAKGYxODc4MDE2Yjg5YjZmMWFmMWQyNWI1ZWZhNzRkY2QyYTIyNTM0N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commit/ac810989a82b523d2c362a48ae27604b1c6456eb","sha":"ac810989a82b523d2c362a48ae27604b1c6456eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/camiloengineer/granulometry-front/commits/ac810989a82b523d2c362a48ae27604b1c6456eb"}],"sha":"f1878016b89b6f1af1d25b5efa74dcd2a225347e","url":"https