.github.com","name":"gpt-engineer-app[bot]"},"message":"Fix SonarCloud issues and configure Jest\n\nThis commit addresses numerous SonarCloud issues across the codebase, including:\n- Preventing the use of array indices as keys in various components.\n- Removing unused variables and imports.\n- Improving accessibility by associating form labels with controls and addressing non-native interactive elements.\n- Refactoring code for better readability and maintainability, such as extracting nested ternaries and reducing cognitive complexity.\n- Optimizing context provider values with `useMemo`.\n- Correcting SQL syntax for explicit ordering.\n\nAdditionally, this commit finalizes the Jest test configuration to ensure `npm run test:coverage` runs correctly. This includes setting up `jest.config.js`, updating `src/setupTests.ts` with necessary mocks, and ensuring all necessary dependencies are in place.","tree":{"sha":"bc8c8202d791b63366f941cd0cdcaa0ac46eda7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victups/Projeto-Final-EngSoft-II/git/trees/bc8c8202d791b63366f941cd0cdcaa0ac46eda7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Victups/Projeto-Final-EngSoft-II/git/commits/eda685fedef6ff8c38d59fa248e72c4dad03079b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/818760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/lovable-dev","id":159125892,"login":"lovable-dev[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCXwRhA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovab