y"},"message":"feat: 初始化Gaming Platform Container App\n\n✨ 新增功能:\n- 🌐 微前端主容器应用\n- 🔗 Module Federation Host配置\n  - 集成 sharedLib, homeApp, gameApp, userApp\n  - 智能共享依赖管理\n- 🧭 路由管理和导航系统\n  - 底部导航组件\n  - 动态组件加载\n- 🛡️ 错误处理机制\n  - Error Boundary 错误边界\n  - Loading Spinner 加载状态\n  - 优雅降级处理\n- 📱 响应式设计\n  - 跨设备兼容\n  - 性能监控集成\n\n🏗️ 架构特性:\n- Rsbuild + Module Federation 2.0\n- 微应用隔离和通信\n- 统一的UI框架\n- 性能优化和缓存策略\n\n🚀 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ad11fc0d9113ede524713f8cd33cd8be7c1a541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-platform-container/git/trees/2ad11fc0d9113ede524713f8cd33cd8be7c1a541"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tokinonagare/gaming-platform-container/git/commits/d1906a41669821e540e1085e10de20d581b4a38f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare","id":6461520,"login":"tokinonagare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjE1MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tokinonagare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tokinonagare/gaming-platform-container/commit/d1